<title>POLAND: POLISH BANK HANDLOWY APRIL NET DOWN TO PLN 26 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANK HANDLOWY APRIL NET DOWN TO PLN 26 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 25.68 vs   43.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   46.77 vs   70.59</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 92.38 vs  135.13</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     159.44 vs  150.25</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					171.25 vs  257.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  273.74 vs  344.55</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		404.70 vs  374.95</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     588.81 vs  465.83</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Handlowy SA. Its</p>
<p>public offering starts in late May.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
